<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AI-Powered Workplace Productivity Assistant</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f7fb;
      color: #1f2937;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      background: #172554;
      color: white;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 16px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #172554;
    }

    textarea,
    input,
    select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      margin: 8px 0 15px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    button {
      background: #2563eb;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-right: 8px;
    }

    button:hover {
      background: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .output {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 18px;
      background: #eff6ff;
      border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .feature {
      padding: 18px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>AI-Powered Workplace Productivity Assistant</h1>
  <p>Smart support for workplace communication, planning and productivity</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <div class="card">
    <h2>What can this assistant help with?</h2>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature">
        <strong>📧 Email Generation</strong>
        <p>Create professional workplace emails.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature">
        <strong>📋 Task Planning</strong>
        <p>Organise tasks and priorities.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature">
        <strong>💬 Communication</strong>
        <p>Improve workplace messages.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature">
        <strong>💡 Productivity</strong>
        <p>Generate practical productivity suggestions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Productivity Assistant</h2>

    <label for="task">What would you like help with?</label>

    <textarea id="task" rows="5"
      placeholder="Example: Write a professional email asking my manager for a meeting."></textarea>

    <button onclick="generateResponse()">Generate Assistance</button>
    <button onclick="clearAssistant()">Clear</button>

    <div id="output" class="output">
      Your generated response will appear here.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Responsible AI</h2>
    <p>
      AI-generated content should be reviewed by a human before being used.
      Users should avoid entering confidential or sensitive workplace information.
      AI should support human decision-making rather than replace human judgement.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>

<footer>
  AI-Powered Workplace Productivity Assistant | AI Skills Acceleration Project
</footer>

<script>
  function generateResponse() {

    const task = document.getElementById("task").value.trim();
    const output = document.getElementById("output");

    if (!task) {
      output.textContent = "Please enter a workplace task or request first.";
      return;
    }

    const lowerTask = task.toLowerCase();

    if (lowerTask.includes("email")) {

      output.textContent =
`Subject: Professional Workplace Request

Dear [Name],

I hope you are doing well.

I am writing regarding ${task.replace(/write a professional email/i, "").trim()}.

Please let me know a suitable time to discuss this further.

Kind regards,
[Your Name]`;

    } else if (
      lowerTask.includes("task") ||
      lowerTask.includes("plan") ||
      lowerTask.includes("priority")
    ) {

      output.textContent =
`Suggested Task Plan

1. Identify the most urgent task.
2. Break large tasks into smaller actions.
3. Complete high-priority work first.
4. Set realistic deadlines.
5. Review your progress at the end of the day.

Productivity tip:
Focus on one important task at a time and minimise unnecessary distractions.`;

    } else if (
      lowerTask.includes("message") ||
      lowerTask.includes("communication")
    ) {

      output.textContent =
`Professional Communication Suggestion

Keep your message clear, respectful and concise.

Suggested structure:
• Greeting
• Main purpose of the message
• Important details
• Requested action
• Professional closing

Always review the final message before sending it.`;

    } else {

      output.textContent =
`Productivity Suggestion

Your request has been received.

Recommended approach:
1. Clearly define the desired outcome.
2. Break the task into smaller steps.
3. Prioritise the most important action.
4. Set a realistic deadline.
5. Review the result before completing the task.

For AI-generated information, verify important details and use human judgement.`;
    }
  }

  function clearAssistant() {
    document.getElementById("task").value = "";
    document.getElementById("output").textContent =
      "Your generated response will appear here.";
  }
</script>

</body>
</html>
